---
layout: base.njk
pageTitle: "Blog | Theo Brucker"
description: "Weekly writing on defense industrial base cybersecurity, CMMC and NIST 800-171, security operations, detection engineering, and the tools I build."
permalink: /blog/index.html
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---

<section id="blog">
  <h1>Blog</h1>
  <p>Weekly notes on defense industrial base security, compliance programs, detection work, and whatever I am building. <a href="/feed.xml">Subscribe via RSS</a>.</p>

  <ul class="project-list">
  {% for post in collections.posts %}
    <li>
      <span class="project-title"><a href="{{ post.url }}" class="project-link">{{ post.data.title }}</a></span>
      <div class="project-tags">
        {% for t in post.data.tags | reject("equalto", "posts") %}<span class="project-tag">{{ t }}</span>{% endfor %}
      </div>
      <p class="post-meta"><time datetime="{{ post.date | dateOnly }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time></p>
      <p>{{ post.data.summary }}</p>
    </li>
  {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
